        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International Florian Appliance Pull Collection</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Florian Refrigerator Handle has a design secret that is not noticeable at once; it is scalloped to make a floral design that adds a quiet beauty to any appliance. The Florian Appliance Pull is available as a 12 inch center to center pull and an 18 inch center to center pull. The Florian Handle comes packaged with the hardware to mount it on an appliance panel.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/florian-cabinet-pull-series-rk-international-cp-845\"><b>Florian Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/large-florian-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-745\"><b>Florian Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PH-8845</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 14-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PH-8846</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
